== [tab] Windows tab of scrollprize.org/docs/06_tutorial_VC3D.md at 823df0788
  | Each VC3D release on the [releases page](https://github.com/ScrollPrize/villa/releases) of the villa
  | repository has two Windows downloads:
  | - **Installer (`VC3D-*-win64.exe`, needs administrator rights):** download it and double click it. Follow
  | the prompts, clicking yes or next where necessary. VC3D is then in the Start menu.
  | - **Portable (`VC3D-*-win64.zip`):** download it, extract its contents to a folder of your choice, and
  | double click `VC3D.exe` in the `bin` folder. There is nothing to install.
  | Both contain VC3D together with the `vc_*` command-line tools, in the `bin` folder (by default `C:\Program
  | Files\VC3D\bin` with the installer). That folder is not added to `PATH`.
  | If Windows shows a warning when you double click the installer or `VC3D.exe`, click "show more details" and
  | then "run anyway".
  Launching the GUI: - **Windows:** Open the application from the Start menu. With the portable .zip, double click `VC3D.exe` in the `bin` folder instead
